---@field signatures? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.A2aV1AgentCardSignatureList JSON Web Signatures computed for this AgentCard.
---@field skills? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.A2aV1AgentSkillList Skills represent a unit of ability an agent can perform. This may somewhat abstract but represents a more focused set of actions that the agent is highly likely to succeed at.
---@field capabilities? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.A2aV1AgentCapabilities A2A Capability set supported by the agent.

