---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.DeleteProjectsLocationsCollectionsDataStoresSiteSearchEngineSitemapsRequest
---@field name string Required. Full resource name of Sitemap, such as `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/dataStores/{data_store}/siteSearchEngine/sitemaps/{sitemap}`. If the caller does not have permission to access the Sitemap, regardless of whether or not it exists, a PERMISSION_DENIED error is returned. If the requested Sitemap does not exist, a NOT_FOUND error is returned.

