---User metadata of the request.
---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistUserMetadata
---@field preferredLanguageCode? string Optional. Preferred language to be used for answering if language detection fails. Also used as the language of error messages created by actions, regardless of language detection results.
---@field timeZone? string Optional. IANA time zone, e.g. Europe/Budapest.

---Discovery Engine Assistant resource.
---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1Assistant
---@field customerPolicy? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistantCustomerPolicy Optional. Customer policy for the assistant.
---@field displayName? string Required. The assistant display name. It must be a UTF-8 encoded string with a length limit of 128 characters.
---@field enabledTools? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistantToolListMap Optional. The enabled tools on this assistant. The keys are data connector resource names, in the format `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/dataConnector`. The values are the tools that the admin enabled on that connector. Admins can selectively enable tools on any of the connectors that they created in the project. For example: ``` { "projects/my-project/locations/global/collections/jira1/dataConnector": { "toolInfo": [ { "toolName": "create_jira_issue", "toolDisplayName": "Create Jira issue" }, { "toolName": "update_jira_issue", "toolDisplayName": "Update Jira issue" } ] } } ```
---@field webGroundingType? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistantWebGroundingTypeEnum Optional. The type of web grounding to use.
---@field defaultWebGroundingToggleOff? boolean Optional. This field controls the default web grounding toggle for end users if `web_grounding_type` is set to `WEB_GROUNDING_TYPE_GOOGLE_SEARCH` or `WEB_GROUNDING_TYPE_ENTERPRISE_WEB_SEARCH`. By default, this field is set to false. If `web_grounding_type` is `WEB_GROUNDING_TYPE_GOOGLE_SEARCH` or `WEB_GROUNDING_TYPE_ENTERPRISE_WEB_SEARCH`, end users will have web grounding enabled by default on UI. If true, grounding toggle will be disabled by default on UI. End users can still enable web grounding in the UI if web grounding is enabled.
---@field description? string Optional. Description for additional information. Expected to be shown on the configuration UI, not to the users of the assistant.
---@field name? string Immutable. Resource name of the assistant. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/engines/{engine}/assistants/{assistant}` It must be a UTF-8 encoded string with a length limit of 1024 characters.
---@field generationConfig? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistantGenerationConfig Optional. Configuration for the generation of the assistant response.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Represents the time when this Assistant was most recently updated.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Represents the time when this Assistant was created.

---Multi-modal content.
---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistantContent
---@field thought? boolean Optional. Indicates if the part is thought from the model.
---@field inlineData? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistantContentBlob Inline binary data.
---@field executableCode? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistantContentExecutableCode Code generated by the model that is meant to be executed.
---@field file? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistantContentFile A file, e.g., an audio summary.
---@field role? string The producer of the content. Can be "model" or "user".
---@field text? string Inline text.
---@field codeExecutionResult? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistantContentCodeExecutionResult Result of executing an ExecutableCode.

