---Config for connecting to NotebookLM Enterprise.
---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1DataStoreFederatedSearchConfigNotebooklmConfig
---@field searchConfig? string Required. Search config name. Format: projects/*/locations/global/notebookLmSearchConfigs/*
---@field notebooks? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.StringList Optional. Restricts this data store to the given notebooks. When empty, the data store covers every notebook the querying user can access, which is the existing behaviour. Each entry is a full notebook resource name, such as `projects/*/locations/*/notebooks/*`. Scoping is enforced on results as well as requested upstream, so a notebook outside this list cannot appear in a search response through this data store even if the backend returns one.

