---@field featureConfig? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1EngineKnowledgeGraphConfigFeatureConfig Optional. Feature config for the Knowledge Graph.
---@field privateKnowledgeGraphTypes? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.StringList Specify entity types to support.
