---@field disablePrivateKgQueryUnderstanding? boolean Whether to disable the private KG query understanding for the engine. Defaults to false if not specified.
---@field disablePrivateKgAutoComplete? boolean Whether to disable the private KG auto complete for the engine. Defaults to false if not specified.

