---@field attributionToken? string A unique attribution token. This should be included in the UserEvent logs resulting from this recommendation, which enables accurate attribution of recommendation model performance.
---@field missingIds? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.StringList IDs of documents in the request that were missing from the default Branch associated with the requested ServingConfig.
