---Document reference.
---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SearchResponseSummaryReference
---@field title? string Title of the document.
---@field document? string Required. Document.name of the document. Full resource name of the referenced document, in the format `projects/*/locations/*/collections/*/dataStores/*/branches/*/documents/*`.
---@field chunkContents? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SearchResponseSummaryReferenceChunkContentList List of cited chunk contents derived from document content.
