---@alias gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SearchResponseSummarySummarySkippedReasonsItemEnumList (gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SearchResponseSummarySummarySkippedReasonsItemEnum|string)[]

