---@field userPseudoId? string A unique identifier for tracking users.
---@field startTime? string Output only. The time the session started.
---@field state? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SessionStateEnum The state of the session.

---Configuration for the session.
