---@field sessionTtl? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SessionConfigSessionTtl Optional. The TTL for the session. If unset, the default value is 60 days.
---@field sessionManagementPolicy? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SessionConfigSessionManagementPolicyEnum|string Optional. Session management policy that defines who will manage the session.

---@alias gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SessionConfigSessionManagementPolicyEnum "SESSION_MANAGEMENT_POLICY_UNSPECIFIED"|"NOT_MANAGED"|"VERTEX_AI_MANAGED"

---Defines the TTL for sessions.
---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SessionConfigSessionTtl
---@field days? number Defines the number of days for session TTL.

