---Represents a turn, including a query from the user and a answer from service.
---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SessionTurn
---@field detailedAnswer? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1Answer Output only. In ConversationalSearchService.GetSession API, if GetSessionRequest.include_answer_details is set to true, this field will be populated when getting answer query session.
---@field detailedAssistAnswer? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1AssistAnswer Output only. In ConversationalSearchService.GetSession API, if GetSessionRequest.include_answer_details is set to true, this field will be populated when getting assistant session.
---@field answer? string Optional. The resource name of the answer to the user query. Only set if the answer generation (/answer API call) happened in this turn.
