---@field matchOperator? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1SuggestionDenyListEntryMatchOperatorEnum|string Required. The match operator to apply for this phrase. Whether to block the exact phrase, or block any suggestions containing this phrase.

