---@field quotaFailure? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1TargetSiteFailureReasonQuotaFailure Failed due to insufficient quota.

---Failed due to insufficient quota.
---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1TargetSiteFailureReasonQuotaFailure
