---@class gcp.discoveryengine_v1.ProvisionProjectsRequest
---@field dataUseTermsVersion? string Required. The version of the [Terms for data use](https://cloud.google.com/retail/data-use-terms) that caller has read and would like to give consent to. Acceptable version is `2022-11-23`, and this may change over time.
---@field provisionIntent? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1ProvisionProjectRequestProvisionIntentEnum|string Optional. The caller states whether the provisioning is for the new or the classic Gemini Enterprise experience.
---@field saasParams? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1ProvisionProjectRequestSaasParams Optional. Parameters for Agentspace.
---@field acceptDataUseTerms? boolean Required. Set to `true` to specify that caller has read and would like to give consent to the [Terms for data use](https://cloud.google.com/retail/data-use-terms).
---@field idpConfig? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1IdpConfig Optional. The identity provider for this location. When provided, the location's AclConfig is set from it as part of provisioning.
