---@field gcsSource? gcp.discoveryengine_v1.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1GcsSource Cloud Storage location for the input content. Supported `data_schema`: * `document_id`: One valid Document.id per line.
---@field parent string Required. The parent resource name, such as `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/collections/{collection}/dataStores/{data_store}/branches/{branch}`.

